      "fontSize": 20,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "Partial save -> no published manifest; retain the previous committed checkpoint.\nPeriodic development eval pauses training. Standalone eval can resolve any compatible snapshot.\nResume restores a committed boundary, not in-flight tool processes or identical remote sampling.",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Partial save -> no published manifest; retain the previous committed checkpoint.\nPeriodic development eval pauses training. Standalone eval can resolve any compatible snapshot.\nResume restores a committed boundary, not in-flight tool processes or identical remote sampling.",
